title = "Parsons Memorial Lodge"
text = "The Sierra Club built this lodge of the meadow's own granite in 1915, in memory of Edward Taylor Parsons, a club director who loved Tuolumne. The club had fought to save Hetch Hetchy, just north of here, and lost it to a dam two years before."

